{"unit_id":"tag:06KR:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的极小（minimal）、光滑（smooth）、形式可表（prorepresentable）的函子中的群胚（groupoids in functors）。若 <MATH_0004> 是以群胚为余纤维（cofibered in groupoids）的范畴之间的范畴等价（equivalence of categories），则 <MATH_0005> 是同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"形式可表"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚"},{"source_term":"cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"以群胚为余纤维"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小","context":"群胚的极小性。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"群胚的光滑性。"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"形式可表","context":"函子群胚的形式可表性。"},{"source_term":"groupoids in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚","context":"本文的函子群胚结构。"},{"source_term":"cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"以群胚为余纤维","context":"范畴的余纤维结构。"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"两商群胚之间的等价。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"结论中的同构。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06KR:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 的拟逆（quasi-inverse）。由引理 <REF_0001> 之前的 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 都是同构（isomorphisms），因此 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006> 都是同构（isomorphisms）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆","context":"范畴等价的拟逆。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"两复合以及两个原态射的同构性。"}],"notes":[]}
